The cool thing about NetHack is that there are two sides to everything.
True, the goblin on level 3 may find a wand of fire (or death) and shoot 
you with it.
But as well, *you* might find a wand of wishing on the first level.
That's luck, of course, but I strongly doubt that you've got anything
against the second kind of luck.
And... you may use the wand of death against other monsters if you
find it first. But other monsters will never wish for things to kill
you with.

